        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "description": "All donations that could not be tied to a streamer: the event total minus the sum of the streamer counters. This holds donations made by people without picking a streamer (the Streamlabs Charity team page without a member), the tickets of the concert on Thursday, all shop donations, and so on. The derived \"mistermv (private counter)\" row is left out of the streamer sum: since 01:08 UTC on Sept 5 it mirrors Domingo's counter, which is already counted once."
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Per interval (total gain minus streamer gains)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "zevent-pg"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
